/// M45 EDGE-014 "operator commands"
/// native entry pact.
/// Source: distribution/README.md
/// symbol "operator commands"
/// (L12-24): pinned native command
/// plus flags plus paths plus harness
/// staging.
/// Disposition: rewire (this row owns
/// the caller pact as reviewable Can
/// facts; the README stays until the
/// integrator rewires callers after
/// each linked row has accepted
/// proof).
/// Protects (this file): the native
/// qualify command (L15) plus harness
/// deny plus staging plus tallies that
/// bound its args.
/// ADAPTATION (noted, plus source
/// lines): verb pins hold command
/// spellings; flag pins hold option
/// spellings; path pins hold arg bytes;
/// note pins hold staging spellings;
/// count pins hold ints tallied from
/// L15 plus file census.
/// python-verb pins python3 (L15);
/// qualify-path pins
/// distribution/qualify.py (L15);
/// archive-flag pins --archive (L15;
/// plus L120 plus L123 plus L127);
/// report-flag pins --report (L15);
/// archive-arg pins
/// /absolute/path/bun-darwin-aarch64.zip
/// (L15; plus L46 plus L94 plus L120);
/// report-arg pins
/// /absolute/path/native-capabilities-v1.json
/// (L15); acquire-note pins upstream.url
/// (L12); digest-note pins archive and
/// executable digests (L19); temp-layout
/// pins temporary versioned layout
/// (L19); runtime-bun pins runtime/bun
/// (L20 plus L53); unrelated-dir pins
/// unrelated directory (L20); empty-home
/// pins empty home (L21); ambient-note
/// pins no ambient runtime configuration
/// (L21); path-deny pins PATH without
/// Bun (L21); native-flag-count pins int
/// (2) from L15; native-path-count pins
/// int (2) from L15; archive-zip-count
/// pins int (4) file-wide.
/// Facet map (command then stage order):
/// python-verb, qualify-path,
/// archive-flag, report-flag,
/// archive-arg, report-arg,
/// acquire-note, digest-note,
/// temp-layout, runtime-bun,
/// unrelated-dir, empty-home,
/// ambient-note, path-deny,
/// native-flag-count, native-path-count,
/// archive-zip-count.
/// The integration roots live in
/// edge-014-roots-green.can; the report
/// plus receipt shape lives in
/// edge-014-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero
/// variants).
/// Environment: none (row lists zero
/// gates; no live run now).
/// Logical gates DOC/SUITE bind at P23;
/// no live run now.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline
/// default bound (no run timeout in this
/// row; binds at P23 like the M31
/// no-run rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (P23
/// accept gate unmet).
/// Intended consumed report: M35
/// HISTORY-127..131 parsed slices for
/// the native leg plus a future
/// qualified integration row (no
/// qualified report yet; P23 unmet).
/// Rewire stays blocked; README
/// intact; no call retired.
/// Case edge/operator-native-entry
/// checks: python-verb, qualify-path,
/// archive-flag, report-flag,
/// archive-arg, report-arg,
/// acquire-note, digest-note,
/// temp-layout, runtime-bun,
/// unrelated-dir, empty-home,
/// ambient-note, path-deny,
/// native-flag-count, native-path-count,
/// archive-zip-count.
/// Shared old files intact; retirement
/// is a later integrator choice.
